  ('02447082-8a48-5305-a902-6bba56e96df3', '6c8eb00a-f68f-5306-9d35-ae99f729e52b', 'd3db20ed-91c7-582a-a091-fa71a4c38b61', 'usr-slack-velen', 'Interpreting “more than 1 stock” as *CU stores whose summarized total stock units (`total_units`) were &gt; 1 in the latest available 24-hour window*:  *Answer: 12,341 CU stores* had more than 1 total stock unit within the latest available 24 hours. The observed CU store base in that same window was *12,461 stores*, so this is about *99.0%* of observed CU stores. [QID: 1] [QID: 2]  *Analysis period:* rolling 24 hours ending at the latest CU run timestamp, *MAY 29, 2026 16:19:57.668 UTC*. The matched completed run summaries in that window ranged from *MAY 28, 2026 16:20:02.504 UTC* to *MAY 29, 2026 16:10:35.041 UTC*. [QID: 1]  Note: the knowledge graph lookup was attempted first, but it was unavailable due to missing Cognee organization configuration, so I used the connected database directly.  *SQL used*  SELECT   COUNT(DISTINCT s.store_cd) AS cu_stores_with_total_stock_units_gt_1_last_24h,   COUNT(*) AS qualifying_run_summaries,   MIN(r.started_at) AS window_min_started_at_utc,   MAX(r.started_at) AS window_max_started_at_utc,   (SELECT MAX(started_at)    FROM store_inventory_runs    WHERE brand=''CU'') AS latest_cu_run_started_at_utc FROM store_inventory_run_summaries s JOIN store_inventory_runs r   ON r.id = s.run_id WHERE s.brand = ''CU''   AND julianday(r.started_at) &gt;= julianday(     (SELECT MAX(started_at) FROM store_inventory_runs WHERE brand=''CU'')   ) - 1   AND julianday(r.started_at) &lt;= julianday(     (SELECT MAX(started_at) FROM store_inventory_runs WHERE brand=''CU'')   )   AND s.total_units &gt; 1;  *Analysis Worklog*  1. Identified the relevant CU inventory summary fields available for store-level stock analysis.  SELECT   m.name AS table_name,   p.cid,   p.name AS column_name,   p.type,   p."notnull",   <http://p.pk|p.pk> FROM sqlite_master AS m JOIN pragma_table_info(m.name) AS p WHERE m.name=''store_inventory_run_summaries'' ORDER BY p.cid;  Learned that `store_inventory_run_summaries` includes store-level summary fields such as `total_items`, `in_stock_items`, `zero_stock_items`, `total_units`, and `max_stock`. [QID: 3]  1. Checked the total CU stores observed in the same latest 24-hour window.  SELECT   COUNT(DISTINCT s.store_cd) AS total_cu_stores_observed_last_24h,   COUNT(*) AS run_summaries_last_24h,   MIN(r.started_at) AS window_min_started_at_utc,   MAX(r.started_at) AS window_max_started_at_utc FROM store_inventory_run_summaries s JOIN store_inventory_runs r   ON r.id=s.run_id WHERE s.brand=''CU''   AND julianday(r.started_at) &gt;= julianday(     (SELECT MAX(started_at) FROM store_inventory_runs WHERE brand=''CU'')   ) - 1   AND julianday(r.started_at) &lt;= julianday(     (SELECT MAX(started_at) FROM store_inventory_runs WHERE brand=''CU'')   );  Learned that *12,461 CU stores* had run summaries in the latest 24-hour window. [QID: 2]  1. Counted CU stores with total_units &gt; 1 in that 24-hour window.  SELECT   COUNT(DISTINCT s.store_cd) AS cu_stores_with_total_stock_units_gt_1_last_24h,   COUNT(*) AS qualifying_run_summaries,   MIN(r.started_at) AS window_min_started_at_utc,   MAX(r.started_at) AS window_max_started_at_utc,   (SELECT MAX(started_at)    FROM store_inventory_runs    WHERE brand=''CU'') AS latest_cu_run_started_at_utc FROM store_inventory_run_summaries s JOIN store_inventory_runs r   ON r.id = s.run_id WHERE s.brand = ''CU''   AND julianday(r.started_at) &gt;= julianday(     (SELECT MAX(started_at) FROM store_inventory_runs WHERE brand=''CU'')   ) - 1   AND julianday(r.started_at) &lt;= julianday(     (SELECT MAX(started_at) FROM store_inventory_runs WHERE brand=''CU'')   )   AND s.total_units &gt; 1;  Learned that *12,341 distinct CU stores* had more than 1 total stock unit in the latest available 24-hour window. [QID: 1]  Evidence  *[1]*  - Rows: 1 - Executed at (UTC): 2026-06-12T04:09:07.752Z  SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT s.store_cd) AS cu_stores_with_total_stock_units_gt_1_last_24h, COUNT(*) AS qualifying_run_summaries, MIN(r.started_at) AS window_min_started_at_utc, MAX(r.started_at) AS window_max_started_at_utc, (SELECT MAX(started_at) FROM st', '2026-06-12T04:09:39.399Z', '2026-06-12T04:09:39.399Z', '[{"type": "section", "block_id": "bMXQ3", "text": {"type": "mrkdwn", "text": "Interpreting “more than 1 stock” as *CU stores whose summarized total stock units (`total_units`) were &gt; 1 in the latest available 24-hour window*:", "verbatim": false}}, {"type": "section", "block_id": "82yM9", "text": {"type": "mrkdwn", "text": "*Answer: 12,341 CU stores* had more than 1 total stock unit within the latest available 24 hours. The observed CU store base in that same window was *12,461 stores*, so this is about *99.0%* of observed CU stores. [QID: 1] [QID: 2]", "verbatim": false}}, {"type": "section", "block_id": "kV7yt", "text": {"type": "mrkdwn", "text": "*Analysis period:* rolling 24 hours ending at the latest CU run timestamp, *MAY 29, 2026 16:19:57.668 UTC*. The matched completed run summaries in that window ranged from *MAY 28, 2026 16:20:02.504 UTC* to *MAY 29, 2026 16:10:35.041 UTC*. [QID: 1]", "verbatim": false}}, {"type": "section", "block_id": "TmrAX", "text": {"type": "mrkdwn", "text": "Note: the knowledge graph lookup was attempted first, but it was unavailable due to missing Cognee organization configuration, so I used the connected database directly.", "verbatim": false}}, {"type": "section", "block_id": "h3wp4", "text": {"type": "mrkdwn", "text": "*SQL used*", "verbatim": false}}, {"type": "rich_text", "block_id": "9Vypu", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_preformatted", "elements": [{"type": "text", "text": "SELECT\n  COUNT(DISTINCT s.store_cd) AS cu_stores_with_total_stock_units_gt_1_last_24h,\n  COUNT(*) AS qualifying_run_summaries,\n  MIN(r.started_at) AS window_min_started_at_utc,\n  MAX(r.started_at) AS window_max_started_at_utc,\n  (SELECT MAX(started_at)\n   FROM store_inventory_runs\n   WHERE brand=''CU'') AS latest_cu_run_started_at_utc\nFROM store_inventory_run_summaries s\nJOIN store_inventory_runs r\n  ON r.id = s.run_id\nWHERE s.brand = ''CU''\n  AND julianday(r.started_at) >= julianday(\n    (SELECT MAX(started_at) FROM store_inventory_runs WHERE brand=''CU'')\n  ) - 1\n  AND julianday(r.started_at) <= julianday(\n    (SELECT MAX(started_at) FROM store_inventory_runs WHERE brand=''CU'')\n  )\n  AND s.total_units > 1;"}]}]}, {"type": "section", "block_id": "MubZP", "text": {"type": "mrkdwn", "text": "*Analysis Worklog*", "verbatim": false}}, {"type": "rich_text", "block_id": "qAFY1", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_list", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_section", "elements": [{"type": "text", "text": "Identified the relevant CU inventory summary fields available for store-level stock analysis."}]}], "style": "ordered", "indent": 0}]}, {"type": "rich_text", "block_id": "G815c", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_preformatted", "elements": [{"type": "text", "text": "SELECT\n  m.name AS table_name,\n  p.cid,\n  p.name AS column_name,\n  p.type,\n  p.\"notnull\",\n  p.pk\nFROM sqlite_master AS m\nJOIN pragma_table_info(m.name) AS p\nWHERE m.name=''store_inventory_run_summaries''\nORDER BY p.cid;"}]}]}, {"type": "section", "block_id": "0TTpp", "text": {"type": "mrkdwn", "text": "Learned that `store_inventory_run_summaries` includes store-level summary fields such as `total_items`, `in_stock_items`, `zero_stock_items`, `total_units`, and `max_stock`. [QID: 3]", "verbatim": false}}, {"type": "rich_text", "block_id": "xB7GU", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_list", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_section", "elements": [{"type": "text", "text": "Checked the total CU stores observed in the same latest 24-hour window."}]}], "style": "ordered", "indent": 0}]}, {"type": "rich_text", "block_id": "o3L7T", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_preformatted", "elements": [{"type": "text", "text": "SELECT\n  COUNT(DISTINCT s.store_cd) AS total_cu_stores_observed_last_24h,\n  COUNT(*) AS run_summaries_last_24h,\n  MIN(r.started_at) AS window_min_started_at_utc,\n  MAX(r.started_at) AS window_max_started_at_utc\nFROM store_inventory_run_summaries s\nJOIN store_inventory_runs r\n  ON r.id=s.run_id\nWHERE s.brand=''CU''\n  AND julianday(r.started_at) >= julianday(\n    (SELECT MAX(started_at) FROM store_inventory_runs WHERE brand=''CU'')\n  ) - 1\n  AND julianday(r.started_at) <= julianday(\n    (SELECT MAX(started_at) FROM store_inventory_runs WHERE brand=''CU'')\n  );"}]}]}, {"type": "section", "block_id": "y2jD4", "text": {"type": "mrkdwn", "text": "Learned that *12,461 CU stores* had run summaries in the latest 24-hour window. [QID: 2]", "verbatim": false}}, {"type": "rich_text", "block_id": "tNNyW", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_list", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_section", "elements": [{"type": "text", "text": "Counted CU stores with "}, {"type": "text", "text": "total_units > 1", "style": {"code": true}}, {"type": "text", "text": " in that 24-hour window."}]}], "style": "ordered", "indent": 0}]}, {"type": "rich_text", "block_id": "iXwgp", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_preformatted", "elements": [{"type": "text", "text": "SELECT\n  COUNT(DISTINCT s.store_cd) AS cu_stores_with_total_stock_units_gt_1_last_24h,\n  COUNT(*) AS qualifying_run_summaries,\n  MIN(r.started_at) AS window_min_started_at_utc,\n  MAX(r.started_at) AS window_max_started_at_utc,\n  (SELECT MAX(started_at)\n   FROM store_inventory_runs\n   WHERE brand=''CU'') AS latest_cu_run_started_at_utc\nFROM store_inventory_run_summaries s\nJOIN store_inventory_runs r\n  ON r.id = s.run_id\nWHERE s.brand = ''CU''\n  AND julianday(r.started_at) >= julianday(\n    (SELECT MAX(started_at) FROM store_inventory_runs WHERE brand=''CU'')\n  ) - 1\n  AND julianday(r.started_at) <= julianday(\n    (SELECT MAX(started_at) FROM store_inventory_runs WHERE brand=''CU'')\n  )\n  AND s.total_units > 1;"}]}]}, {"type": "section", "block_id": "1umfd", "text": {"type": "mrkdwn", "text": "Learned that *12,341 distinct CU stores* had more than 1 total stock unit in the latest available 24-hour window. [QID: 1]", "verbatim": false}}, {"type": "header", "block_id": "jnn+G", "text": {"type": "plain_text", "text": "Evidence", "emoji": true}}, {"type": "section", "block_id": "o9SWs", "text": {"type": "mrkdwn", "text": "*[1]*", "verbatim": false}}, {"type": "rich_text", "block_id": "zaF8L", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_list", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_section", "elements": [{"type": "text", "text": "Rows: 1"}]}, {"type": "rich_text_section", "elements": [{"type": "text", "text": "Executed at (UTC): 2026-06-12T04"}, {"type": "emoji", "name": "09"}, {"type": "text", "text": "07.752Z"}]}], "style": "bullet", "indent": 0}]}, {"type": "rich_text", "block_id": "v4Pnp", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_preformatted", "elements": [{"type": "text", "text": "SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT s.store_cd) AS cu_stores_with_total_stock_units_gt_1_last_24h, COUNT(*) AS qualifying_run_summaries, MIN(r.started_at) AS window_min_started_at_utc, MAX(r.started_at) AS window_max_started_at_utc, (SELECT MAX(started_at) FROM store_inventory_runs WHERE brand=''CU'') AS latest_cu_run_started_at_utc FROM store_inventory_run_summaries s JOIN store_inventory_runs r ON r.id = s.run_id WHERE s.brand = ''CU'' AND julianday(r.started_at) >= julianday((SELECT MAX(started_at) FROM store_inventory_runs WHERE brand=''CU'')) - 1 AND julianday(r.started_at) <= julianday((SELECT MAX(started_at) FROM store_inventory_runs WHERE brand=''CU'')) AND s.total_units > 1;"}]}]}, {"type": "section", "block_id": "fw75B", "text": {"type": "mrkdwn", "text": "*[2]*", "verbatim": false}}, {"type": "rich_text", "block_id": "Rxfz9", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_list", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_section", "elements": [{"type": "text", "text": "Rows: 1"}]}, {"type": "rich_text_section", "elements": [{"type": "text", "text": "Executed at (UTC): 2026-06-12T04"}, {"type": "emoji", "name": "08"}, {"type": "text", "text": "49.889Z"}]}], "style": "bullet", "indent": 0}]}, {"type": "rich_text", "block_id": "NIugK", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_preformatted", "elements": [{"type": "text", "text": "SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT s.store_cd) AS total_cu_stores_observed_last_24h, COUNT(*) AS run_summaries_last_24h, MIN(r.started_at) AS window_min_started_at_utc, MAX(r.started_at) AS window_max_started_at_utc FROM store_inventory_run_summaries s JOIN store_inventory_runs r ON r.id=s.run_id WHERE s.brand=''CU'' AND julianday(r.started_at) >= julianday((SELECT MAX(started_at) FROM store_inventory_runs WHERE brand=''CU'')) - 1 AND julianday(r.started_at) <= julianday((SELECT MAX(started_at) FROM store_inventory_runs WHERE brand=''CU''));"}]}]}, {"type": "section", "block_id": "4sGI6", "text": {"type": "mrkdwn", "text": "*[3]*", "verbatim": false}}, {"type": "rich_text", "block_id": "3Rgbd", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_list", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_section", "elements": [{"type": "text", "text": "Rows: 9"}]}, {"type": "rich_text_section", "elements": [{"type": "text", "text": "Executed at (UTC): 2026-06-12T04"}, {"type": "emoji", "name": "08"}, {"type": "text", "text": "32.323Z"}]}], "style": "bullet", "indent": 0}]}, {"type": "rich_text", "block_id": "/7s9R", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_preformatted", "elements": [{"type": "text", "text": "SELECT m.name AS table_name, p.cid, p.name AS column_name, p.type, p.\"notnull\", p.pk FROM sqlite_master AS m JOIN pragma_table_info(m.name) AS p WHERE m.name=''store_inventory_run_summaries'' ORDER BY p.cid;"}]}]}]')
