insert into briar_channel_messages (id, channel_id, parent_message_id, author_user_id, body, created_at, updated_at, blocks_json)
values
  ('7b3f1a22-305e-536d-bde8-5c7ff6335fd6', '6c8eb00a-f68f-5306-9d35-ae99f729e52b', 'dfc59542-c9cc-5fce-b739-84afe8df90b1', 'usr-slack-velen', '사용한 성공 조건: `lower(status) IN (''success'',''succeeded'',''ok'',''completed'')`  SELECT brand, COUNT(*) AS successful_scan_count FROM store_scan_logs WHERE checked_at &gt;= datetime(''now'', ''-48 hours'')   AND lower(status) IN (''success'',''succeeded'',''ok'',''completed'') GROUP BY brand ORDER BY successful_scan_count DESC;  Analysis Worklog  1. 스캔 로그 테이블과 관련 컬럼을 확인했습니다.  SELECT name, type FROM sqlite_master WHERE type IN (''table'',''view'') ORDER BY name LIMIT 100;  SELECT name, sql FROM sqlite_master WHERE type IN (''table'',''view'') ORDER BY name LIMIT 100;  `store_scan_logs` 테이블에 `brand`, `checked_at`, `status` 컬럼이 있어 브랜드별 성공 스캔 집계에 사용할 수 있음을 확인했습니다. [QID: 4] [QID: 5]  1. 최근 48시간의 상태별/브랜드별 성공 스캔수를 집계했습니다.  SELECT status, COUNT(*) AS scan_count FROM store_scan_logs WHERE checked_at &gt;= datetime(''now'', ''-48 hours'') GROUP BY status ORDER BY scan_count DESC;  SELECT brand, COUNT(*) AS successful_scan_count FROM store_scan_logs WHERE checked_at &gt;= datetime(''now'', ''-48 hours'')   AND lower(status) IN (''success'',''succeeded'',''ok'',''completed'') GROUP BY brand ORDER BY successful_scan_count DESC;  SELECT MIN(checked_at) AS min_checked_at,        MAX(checked_at) AS max_checked_at,        COUNT(*) AS total_logs FROM store_scan_logs WHERE checked_at &gt;= datetime(''now'', ''-48 hours'');  최근 48시간 내 전체 로그가 0건이었고, 브랜드별 성공 스캔 집계 결과도 비어 있었습니다. [QID: 6] [QID: 2] [QID: 1]  1. 데이터가 없는 이유를 확인하기 위해 전체 로그의 최신 시각을 점검했습니다.  SELECT MIN(checked_at) AS min_checked_at,        MAX(checked_at) AS max_checked_at,        COUNT(*) AS total_logs FROM store_scan_logs;  SELECT status, COUNT(*) AS scan_count FROM store_scan_logs GROUP BY status ORDER BY scan_count DESC LIMIT 20;  SELECT checked_at, brand, status, item_count FROM store_scan_logs ORDER BY checked_at DESC LIMIT 10;  전체 데이터의 최신 `checked_at`이 2026-05-29 17:17:44.925 UTC로, 현재 기준 최근 48시간 범위보다 이전임을 확인했습니다. [QID: 3] [QID: 7]  참고: 조직 지식 그래프 조회를 먼저 시도했지만, 현재 조직 Cognee 설정에 `baseUrl`/`apiKey`가 없어 조회할 수 없었습니다.  Evidence  *[1]*  - Rows: 1 - Executed at (UTC): 2026-06-17T04:32:40.396Z  SELECT MIN(checked_at) AS min_checked_at, MAX(checked_at) AS max_checked_at, COUNT(*) AS total_logs FROM store_scan_logs WHERE checked_at &gt;= datetime(''now'', ''-48 hours'');  *[2]*  - Rows: 0 - Executed at (UTC): 2026-06-17T04:32:40.396Z  SELECT brand, COUNT(*) AS successful_scan_count FROM store_scan_logs WHERE checked_at &gt;= datetime(''now'', ''-48 hours'') AND lower(status) IN (''success'',''succeeded'',''ok'',''completed'') GROUP BY brand ORDER BY successful_scan_count DESC;  *[3]*  - Rows: 1 - Executed at (UTC): 2026-06-17T04:32:49.028Z  SELECT MIN(checked_at) AS min_checked_at, MAX(checked_at) AS max_checked_at, COUNT(*) AS total_logs FROM store_scan_logs;  *[4]*  - Rows: 22 - Executed at (UTC): 2026-06-17T04:32:11.058Z  SELECT name, type FROM sqlite_master WHERE type IN (''table'',''view'') ORDER BY name LIMIT 100;  *[5]*  - Rows: 22 - Executed at (UTC): 2026-06-17T04:32:28.043Z  SELECT name, sql FROM sqlite_master WHERE type IN (''table'',''view'') ORDER BY name LIMIT 100;  *[6]*  - Rows: 0 - Executed at (UTC): 2026-06-17T04:32:40.396Z  SELECT status, COUNT(*) AS scan_count FROM store_scan_logs WHERE checked_at &gt;= datetime(''now'', ''-48 hours'') GROUP BY status ORDER BY scan_count DESC;  *[7]*  - Rows: 10 - Executed at (UTC): 2026-06-17T04:32:49.028Z  SELECT checked_at, brand, status, item_count FROM store_scan_logs ORDER BY checked_at DESC LIMIT 10;', '2026-06-17T04:33:18.135Z', '2026-06-17T04:33:18.135Z', '[{"type": "section", "block_id": "x1tTz", "text": {"type": "mrkdwn", "text": "사용한 성공 조건: `lower(status) IN (''success'',''succeeded'',''ok'',''completed'')`", "verbatim": false}}, {"type": "rich_text", "block_id": "hZ45N", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_preformatted", "elements": [{"type": "text", "text": "SELECT brand, COUNT(*) AS success