과/잔존 상태가 누적된 상태", "style": {"bold": true}}, {"type": "text", "text": "로 보입니다."}]}, {"type": "rich_text_section", "elements": [{"type": "text", "text": "전체적으로는 "}, {"type": "text", "text": "CU 중심의 backlog와 D1 용량 초과 여파가 가장 큰 리스크", "style": {"bold": true}}, {"type": "text", "text": "입니다. 특히 이전 결과에서 최신 실패 원인이 "}, {"type": "text", "text": "D1_ERROR: Exceeded maximum DB size", "style": {"code": true}}, {"type": "text", "text": "였고, 이번 브랜드별 집계에서도 CU pending/failure가 가장 큽니다."}]}], "style": "bullet", "indent": 0}]}, {"type": "header", "block_id": "rgaWf", "text": {"type": "plain_text", "text": "실행 SQL", "emoji": true}}, {"type": "rich_text", "block_id": "PBCAZ", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_preformatted", "elements": [{"type": "text", "text": "SELECT\n brand,\n status AS target_status,\n COUNT(*) AS target_count\nFROM scheduler_targets\nGROUP BY brand, status\nORDER BY brand, target_status;"}]}]}, {"type": "rich_text", "block_id": "A6in0", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_preformatted", "elements": [{"type": "text", "text": "SELECT\n brand,\n latest_status,\n COUNT(*) AS store_count,\n SUM(latest_item_count) AS total_latest_items,\n MAX(latest_started_at) AS latest_started_at_utc,\n MAX(latest_finished_at) AS latest_finished_at_utc,\n MAX(latest_success_at) AS latest_success_at_utc,\n SUM(CASE WHEN latest_error IS NOT NULL AND latest_error <> '''' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS stores_with_error\nFROM store_inventory_schedule_job_stats\nGROUP BY brand, latest_status\nORDER BY brand, latest_status;"}]}]}, {"type": "rich_text", "block_id": "AW4xX", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_preformatted", "elements": [{"type": "text", "text": "SELECT\n brand,\n status AS dispatch_status,\n COUNT(*) AS dispatch_count,\n MIN(enqueued_at) AS earliest_enqueued_at_utc,\n MAX(enqueued_at) AS latest_enqueued_at_utc,\n MAX(sent_at) AS latest_sent_at_utc,\n SUM(CASE WHEN error IS NOT NULL AND error <> '''' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS error_count\nFROM scheduled_crawl_dispatches\nGROUP BY brand, status\nORD