values
  ('fb51361b-a93f-5887-80c9-997922a19eff', 'a4f3887e-60b5-59f9-b4a2-8dd3f57ee239', '616d88b2-b8b6-56a8-b478-0cf74d438c4a', 'usr-slack-velen', '따라서 *가장 최근 집계된 프로모션 데이터에서 active는 1,516개, inactive는 3개*로 볼 수 있습니다. 다만 최신 run의 `promotion_count=1,516`은 active 프로모션 수와 일치하고, inactive 3개는 latest state에 남아 있는 과거 종료/비활성 프로모션입니다.  사용한 SQL:  SELECT  active,  COUNT(*) AS promotion_count FROM store_promotion_latest_state WHERE lower(brand) = ''cu''  AND store_cd = ''__GLOBAL__'' GROUP BY active ORDER BY active DESC;  SELECT  COUNT(*) AS total_latest_state_count,  SUM(CASE WHEN active = 1 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS active_count,  SUM(CASE WHEN active = 0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS inactive_count,  MAX(last_seen_at) AS max_last_seen_utc,  datetime(MAX(last_seen_at), ''+9 hours'') AS max_last_seen_kst FROM store_promotion_latest_state WHERE lower(brand) = ''cu''  AND store_cd = ''__GLOBAL__'';  SELECT  id,  promotion_count,  started_at,  datetime(started_at, ''+9 hours'') AS started_kst,  status FROM store_promotion_runs WHERE lower(brand) = ''cu''  AND store_cd = ''__GLOBAL__'' ORDER BY started_at DESC LIMIT 1;  레퍼런스 및 분석 작업 로그: <https://velen.wordbricks.ai/cvs/chat/01KWARSSEFG4AQJ16H7M5B7JAX|Velen에서 보기>', '2026-06-29T23:59:38.407Z', '2026-06-29T23:59:38.407Z', '[{"type": "section", "block_id": "UMRKG", "text": {"type": "mrkdwn", "text": "따라서 *가장 최근 집계된 프로모션 데이터에서 active는 1,516개, inactive는 3개*로 볼 수 있습니다. 다만 최신 run의 `promotion_count=1,516`은 active 프로모션 수와 일치하고, inactive 3개는 latest state에 남아 있는 과거 종료/비활성 프로모션입니다.", "verbatim": false}}, {"type": "section", "block_id": "4VNMf", "text": {"type": "mrkdwn", "text": "사용한 SQL:", "verbatim": false}}, {"type": "rich_text", "block_id": "fYUDP", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_preformatted", "elements": [{"type": "text", "text": "SELECT\n active,\n COUNT(*) AS promotion_count\nFROM store_promotion_latest_state\nWHERE lower(brand) = ''cu''\n AND store_cd = ''__GLOBAL__''\nGROUP BY active\nORDER BY active DESC;"}]}]}, {"type": "rich_text", "block_id": "B3bkt", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_preformatted", "elements": [{"type": "text", "text": "SELECT\n COUNT(*) AS total_latest_state_count,\n SUM(CASE WHEN active = 1 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS active_count,\n SUM(CASE WHEN active = 0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS inactive_count,\n MAX(last_seen_at) AS max_last_seen_utc,\n datetime(MAX(last_seen_at), ''+9 hours'') AS max_last_seen_kst\nFROM store_promotion_latest_state\nWHERE lower(brand) = ''cu''\n AND store_cd = ''__GLOBAL__'';"}]}]}, {"type": "rich_text", "block_id": "rm++x", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_preformatted", "elements": [{"type": "text", "text": "SELECT\n id,\n promotion_count,\n started_at,\n datetime(started_at, ''+9 hours'') AS started_kst,\n status\nFROM store_promotion_runs\nWHERE lower(brand) = ''cu''\n AND store_cd = ''__GLOBAL__''\nORDER BY started_at DESC\nLIMIT 1;"}]}]}, {"type": "section", "block_id": "Lb2Nb", "text": {"type": "mrkdwn", "text": "레퍼런스 및 분석 작업 로그: <https://velen.wordbricks.ai/cvs/chat/01KWARSSEFG4AQJ16H7M5B7JAX|Velen에서 보기>", "verbatim": false}}]'),
