  ('5a9d7b90-2a27-5222-b8b8-71848f4f755c', 'a4f3887e-60b5-59f9-b4a2-8dd3f57ee239', '8039eac3-5001-512d-92de-e8b0cba2c0d6', 'usr-slack-velen', '주의할 점은, *`last_seen_at`이 2026-06-29 16:01:03 KST로 동일하게 찍혀 있어도 `active=1` 상태*라는 점입니다. 따라서 이 테이블에서는 `active=1`을 현재 활성 여부로 해석하고, `last_seen_at`은 마지막으로 해당 row가 관측/갱신된 시점으로 보는 것이 안전합니다.  사용한 SQL:  SELECT  COUNT(*) AS total_one_plus_one,  SUM(CASE WHEN starts_at IS NOT NULL AND starts_at &lt;&gt; '''' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS has_starts_at,  SUM(CASE WHEN ends_at IS NOT NULL AND ends_at &lt;&gt; '''' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS has_ends_at,  MIN(starts_at) AS min_starts_at_utc,  MAX(starts_at) AS max_starts_at_utc,  MIN(ends_at) AS min_ends_at_utc,  MAX(ends_at) AS max_ends_at_utc,  MIN(first_seen_at) AS min_first_seen_at_utc,  MAX(first_seen_at) AS max_first_seen_at_utc,  MIN(last_seen_at) AS min_last_seen_at_utc,  MAX(last_seen_at) AS max_last_seen_at_utc,  COUNT(DISTINCT source) AS source_count,  COUNT(DISTINCT scope) AS scope_count FROM store_promotion_latest_state WHERE lower(brand) = ''cu''  AND store_cd = ''__GLOBAL__''  AND active = 1  AND promotion_kind = ''one_plus_one'';  SELECT  source,  scope,  label,  COUNT(*) AS n,  SUM(CASE WHEN sale_price IS NOT NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS has_sale_price,  SUM(CASE WHEN tag_price IS NOT NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS has_tag_price,  SUM(CASE WHEN discount_price IS NOT NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS has_discount_price,  SUM(CASE WHEN image_url IS NOT NULL AND image_url &lt;&gt; '''' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS has_image_url FROM store_promotion_latest_state WHERE lower(brand) = ''cu''  AND store_cd = ''__GLOBAL__''  AND active = 1  AND promotion_kind = ''one_plus_one'' GROUP BY source, scope, label ORDER BY n DESC;  SELECT  title,  item_cd,  sale_price,  tag_price,  discount_price,  starts_at,  ends_at,  image_url,  first_seen_at,  last_seen_at,  last_changed_at,  raw_json FROM store_promotion_latest_state WHERE lower(brand) = ''cu''  AND store_cd = ''__GLOBAL__''  AND active = 1  AND promotion_kind = ''one_plus_one'' ORDER BY title LIMIT 5;  레퍼런스 및 분석 작업 로그: <https://velen.wordbricks.ai/cvs/chat/01KWARSSEFG4AQJ16H7M5B7JAX|Velen에서 보기>', '2026-06-30T00:25:17.997Z', '2026-06-30T00:25:17.997Z', '[{"type": "section", "block_id": "HDlHr", "text": {"type": "mrkdwn", "text": "주의할 점은, *`last_seen_at`이 2026-06-29 16:01:03 KST로 동일하게 찍혀 있어도 `active=1` 상태*라는 점입니다. 따라서 이 테이블에서는 `active=1`을 현재 활성 여부로 해석하고, `last_seen_at`은 마지막으로 해당 row가 관측/갱신된 시점으로 보는 것이 안전합니다.", "verbatim": false}}, {"type": "section", "block_id": "cTcYl", "text": {"type": "mrkdwn", "text": "사용한 SQL:", "verbatim": false}}, {"type": "rich_text", "block_id": "iCLPv", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_preformatted", "elements": [{"type": "text", "text": "SELECT\n COUNT(*) AS total_one_plus_one,\n SUM(CASE WHEN starts_at IS NOT NULL AND starts_at <> '''' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS has_starts_at,\n SUM(CASE WHEN ends_at IS NOT NULL AND ends_at <> '''' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS has_ends_at,\n MIN(starts_at) AS min_starts_at_utc,\n MAX(starts_at) AS max_starts_at_utc,\n MIN(ends_at) AS min_ends_at_utc,\n MAX(ends_at) AS max_ends_at_utc,\n MIN(first_seen_at) AS min_first_seen_at_utc,\n MAX(first_seen_at) AS max_first_seen_at_utc,\n MIN(last_seen_at) AS min_last_seen_at_utc,\n MAX(last_seen_at) AS max_last_seen_at_utc,\n COUNT(DISTINCT source) AS source_count,\n COUNT(DISTINCT scope) AS scope_count\nFROM store_promotion_latest_state\nWHERE lower(brand) = ''cu''\n AND store_cd = ''__GLOBAL__''\n AND active = 1\n AND promotion_kind = ''one_plus_one'';"}]}]}, {"type": "rich_text", "block_id": "W8aSu", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_preformatted", "elements": [{"type": "text", "text": "SELECT\n source,\n scope,\n label,\n COUNT(*) AS n,\n SUM(CASE WHEN sale_price IS NOT NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS has_sale_price,\n SUM(CASE WHEN tag_price IS NOT NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS has_tag_price,\n SUM(CASE WHEN discount_price IS NOT NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS has_discount_price,\n SUM(CASE WHEN image_url IS NOT NULL AND image_url <> '''' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS has_image_url\nFROM store_promotion_latest_state\nWHERE lower(brand) = ''cu''\n AND store_cd = ''__GLOBAL__''\n AND active = 1\n AND promotion_kind = ''one_plus_one''\nGROUP BY source, scope, label\nORDER BY n DESC;"}]}]}, {"type": "rich_text", "block_id": "2Uz8G", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_preformatted", "elements": [{"type": "text", "text": "SELECT\n title,\n item_cd,\n sale_price,\n tag_price,\n discount_price,\n starts_at,\n ends_at,\n image_url,\n first_seen_at,\n last_seen_at,\n last_changed_at,\n raw_json\nFROM store_promotion_latest_state\nWHERE lower(brand) = ''cu''\n AND store_cd = ''__GLOBAL__''\n AND active = 1\n AND promotion_kind = ''one_plus_one''\nORDER BY title\nLIMIT 5;"}]}]}, {"type": "section", "block_id": "d8MOY", "text": {"type": "mrkdwn", "text": "레퍼런스 및 분석 작업 로그: <https://velen.wordbricks.ai/cvs/chat/01KWARSSEFG4AQJ16H7M5B7JAX|Velen에서 보기>", "verbatim": false}}]'),
