  ('4da5b661-2b37-5775-ad90-5b65e6836760', 'ce5b2b18-914c-57af-aef4-fd0a71464e97', 'ed0210f2-0a06-5f2f-869b-3c9ad6c8a5e5', 'usr-slack-sophia', '일주일 전 주문하면 30% 할인, 전날 주문하면 10% 할인 같은, 케이터링에서 가능한 모델들을 도입하는것도 강점이 될 수 있음', '2026-07-16T07:41:10.311Z', '2026-07-16T07:41:10.311Z', '[{"type": "rich_text", "block_id": "QiY9m", "elements": [{"type": "rich_text_section", "elements": [{"type": "text", "text": "일주일 전 주문하면 30% 할인, 전날 주문하면 10% 할인 같은, 케이터링에서 가능한 모델들을 도입하는것도 강점이 될 수 있음"}]}]}]'),
  ('20abff05-0f08-58dd-b450-a4625a2a4d6a', '6c8eb00a-f68f-5306-9d35-ae99f729e52b', '629ef8d5-b60b-54e2-9376-8c07e031abef', 'usr-slack-velen', '*Why the decline is not commercially interpretable yet*  - Coverage contracted sharply: fact rows fell 55.674% and active item-store pairs fell 41.930%, while active stores fell only 8.211%. [2] - Five stores—1112150, 1112179, 1101323, 1111389, and 1110280—accounted for 80.675% of the estimated-sales decline. Excluding them attenuates the movement to -16.669% for estimated-sales amount and -9.751% for inferred units, showing that the headline is highly sensitive to this store set. [4] [5] - Across 2026-07-05 through 2026-07-08, TOUSLESJOURS transitioned from transform inventory-events-jsonl-to-hourly-inferred-sales-v1.0.0 / schema v1 to transform inventory-events-jsonl-to-hourly-inferred-sales-v2.0.0 / schema v2; the latest week uses the latter version. [6] - The interval-quality population simultaneously shifted from NULL toward long_interval, with large opposing contributions to estimated-sales amount. This is a definition/logging-change signal, not proof of cause. [7] [8]  *Recommended actions*  1. Data Engineering: Reprocess both UTC windows in curated_inventory_v2.hourly_inferred_sales under one transform/schema version. Record resulting fact rows, active item-store pairs, inferred units, and estimated-sales amount for each window so comparability can be confirmed. 2. Data Quality: Audit source intervals and allocation behavior for stores 1112150, 1112179, 1101323, 1111389, and 1110280, focusing on the preceding-week to latest-week transition and identifying whether their near-total measured decline reflects missing coverage, interval handling, or valid source activity. [4] [5] 3. Analytics: After reprocessing, rerun the provider and store decompositions and withhold commercial interpretation until the coverage, quality-status, and weekly totals reconcile on the common version.', '2026-07-16T08:00:17.350Z', '2026-07-16T0